{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54133","headline":"句 一 · 邵谒","name":"句 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不知天上月，曾别几多人？\n（见宋江少虞《皇朝事实类苑》卷五九引李錞《李希声诗话》引）（〖1〗《李希声诗话》云：「余亡友李秉彝德叟寒暑假爲余曰：『家藏唐邵谒诗八十篇，甚工。\n谒选於吏部，部中牓此诗曰：有能过此者，当先注官。\n衆无间言。\n……』余欲借传，因循不果。\n」按：今传谒诗仅三十二首，未及半数。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}